    "group": "Emperor’s Chosen",
    "summary": "When a unit of yours uses Rendax from [Martial Ka'tah](vsdata:ability/adeptus-custodes.martial-katah), it also gains this effect: you may pick an enemy **MONSTER** or **VEHICLE** unit **engaged** with it and roll a single D6.\n\n- On a roll of 1-2, that enemy unit takes 1 **[mortal wound](vsdata:core-rule/mortal-wounds)**.\n- On a roll of 3-5, it takes D3 mortal wounds.\n- On a roll of 6, it takes 3 mortal wounds.",
